// BT-4099: an `Object` subclass with custom `new` / `new:` (`Value` seals
// both, so only `Object` subclasses can define them). Never direct-call
// eligible (no constructor anchor), so construction routes through the
// class gen_server however the send is reached. Each custom body answers
// the builder pid: a pid (not an instance) proves the custom body ran,
// and anything but the test pid proves the gen_server path.

Object subclass: DirectCtorCustom

  class new => Erlang erlang self

  class new: _init => Erlang erlang self
